# face-image: img/parlament_de_catalunya.jpg

= Parlament de Catalunya

{!<div id="parlament" data-widget="hemicycle" data-props='{"configFrom":"parlament_hemicycle"}'></div>!}
{!<div style='margin-top: -2em; width: 100%; font-style: italic; text-align: center'>!} Majority: [+ parlament_s_majority +]{!</div>!}
[? if not cat_caretaker_gov: {!<div style='margin-top: -1em; width: 100%; text-align: center'>!} Speaker of the House:<br/>[+ speaker +] ([+ speaker_party +]){!</div>!} ?]

[? if cat_caretaker_gov : The Parlament is currently dissolved, so no parliamentary actions are possible at this point. ?][? if not cat_caretaker_gov: As a party with representation in the Parlament, we have the opportunity to use our seats to make our voice heard and push for new initiatives and legislation. ?]

- @politica_social
- @rights
- @finances
- @sovereignty
- @budget
- @root: We don't need to do anything in the Parlament right now


@politica_social
title: Política social
subtitle: We have long championed the need for more social policies
unavailable-subtitle: Our lawmakers are still unready. Next action possible in [+ parlament_timer +] [? if parlament_timer > 1:  months.?][? if parlament_timer = 1: month.?]
choose-if: parlament_action_open

**Política Social**

In times of economic struggle, the Catalan social safety net is under pressure. As long-time supporters of a strong welfare state, we can use many legislative levers to expand it and cover the most pressing issues: from unaffordable energy and housing to climate change.

- @parlament_energy_poverty
- @parlament_housing
- @parlament_climate_change
- @parlament_urbanism
- @parlament_options: Let us consider other options

@rights
title: Rights and Liberties
subtitle: As a left party, pushing for further freedoms is something that has always been on the agenda
choose-if: parlament_action_open
unavailable-subtitle: Our lawmakers are still unready. Next action possible in [+ parlament_timer +] [? if parlament_timer > 1:  months.?][? if parlament_timer = 1: month.?]

**Rights and Liberties**

In our push for further democratization and expansion of individual and collective rights, there's still plenty to be done. 

- @parlament_civil_law
- @parlament_police
- @parlament_lgbt
- @parlament_digital
- @parlament_options: Let us consider other options

@finances
title: Finances and Economy
subtitle: Nothing is free, and in finances lay many levers for a more just society
choose-if: parlament_action_open
unavailable-subtitle: Our lawmakers are still unready. Next action possible in [+ parlament_timer +] [? if parlament_timer > 1:  months.?][? if parlament_timer = 1: month.?]

**Finances and Economy**

It's no secret that the Generalitat's financial situation is not the best. 

- @parlament_comerce
- @parlament_inheritance_tax
- @parlament_bank_taxes
- @parlament_energy_tax
- @parlament_options: Let us consider other options

@sovereignty
title: Catalan Sovereignty
subtitle: No other institutional lever is as symbolic and powerful as pushing for further sovereignty than the Parlament
choose-if: parlament_action_open
unavailable-subtitle: Our lawmakers are still unready. Next action possible in [+ parlament_timer +] [? if parlament_timer > 1:  months.?][? if parlament_timer = 1: month.?]

**On Catalan Sovereignty**

Despite the Parlament being legally limited in its powers, it is still symbolically the highest representative body of the Catalan people. Using that, we can still push for further action within its walls by passing laws allowing the Generalitat and other official bodies more options. It's no secret that, no matter how water-tight we make these, the Constitutional Court will most probably strike them down. 

- @parlament_sovereignty_declaration
- @parlament_international
- @parlament_local
- @parlament_non_binding_consultations
- @parlament_referendum
- @parlament_dui
- @parlament_options: Let us consider other options

